#AREA Empire of the Gnomes~

#AUTHORS Presto~

#HELPS
-1 EMPIREOFTHEGNOMES GNOMEEMPIRE~
This area was designed to be the basis of the Gnome Empire, which consists of
every gnome who proves himself worthy to become a member.  In this area you'll 
find the central castle, all the shops and guilds which come with an empire, 
and you'll notice that this area has a particular restriction which you won't 
find elsewhere.  This area is for GNOMES OF THE EMPIRE ONLY!

     (-) Back



{-}PRESTO
~
0 $~

#RANGES 0 99 0 99

#FLAGS AFLAG_NOTELEPORT

