#12302
gate empire~
The Gate to the Empire~
The gate to the empire of the gnomes is here.~
The gate restricts all non-members of the empire from entering.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_SMART|ACT_RACE
AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN|AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_TONGUES|AFF_ETHEREAL
0 S
95 0 0 1d1+14999 1d1+99
346820 RACE_GNOME
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>all_greet_prog 100~
if race($n) == 5
  tell $n Do you wish to enter the empire?
endif
~
>speech_prog yes~
if race($n) != 5
  tell $n You are not a gnome.  You may not enter.
else
  if quest(0,2,$n) == 1
    tell $n You may enter.
    mpat 12363 mpecho $n has entered the empire.
    mptransfer $n 12363
    mpat 12363 mpforce $n look
    mpecho $n has entered the empire.
  else
    tell $n You are not a member of the empire.
  endif
endif
~
>speech_prog no~
tell $n Ok.  Have a nice day.  =)
~
