0 0 -1 0
3 0 13
E
torch~
This torch is your proof of membership in the empire of the gnomes.
The handle is colored crimson, which symbolizes the blood of our enemies.
The torch itself is made of ivory, which stands for our wisdom.
If you ever kill a soldier of the empire, or violate the rules of the
empire, your membership will be revoked.~
A
APPLY_WIS 2
A
APPLY_DAMROLL 2
A
APPLY_AC -2
P 1
TRIG_TICK 50
OPROG_IF OIF_USER_RACE ! RACE_GNOME 2 0
P 2
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_JUNK
P 3
TRIG_UNKNOWN 100 exittheempire
OPROG_JUNK
