#12324
membership application~
a gnome empire membership application~
A gnome empire membership application lies here.~
You must "sign" this application to become a member of the gnome empire,
and to receive your torch.~
ITEM_TYPE_TRASH
ITEM_FLAG_MAGIC|ITEM_FLAG_LEVEL
ITEM_WEAR_TAKE
0 0 0 0
1 0 1
P 1
TRIG_UNKNOWN 100 sign
OPROG_IF OIF_USER_RACE = RACE_GNOME 2 3
P 2
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_GOD_COMMAND
mpOLOAD 12300 & mpmset $ questr 12300 0 2 1~
P 2
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_ECHO
Congratulations!  You are now a member of the Gnome Empire!~
P 2
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_JUNK
P 3
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_ECHO
You are not a Gnome.  You cannot join their empire.~
P 3
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_JUNK
